      "content": "\"rest in this quiet, empty space\"... that sounds so peaceful, honestly. Compared to the noise and the constant feeling of being a pariah, it almost sounds better than trying to rebuild. Sometimes i wonder if there's even a point to rebuilding once everything has been stripped away. like, if the cost of being a good person is just endless misery, why bother?",
